+// HUPI Code patch: the status bar's "Copilot status" entry (codicon-copilot,
+// bottom right) is Copilot-only in a HUPI Code build. Its popup offers
+// "Set up Copilot to use AI features" with a "Use AI Features" button that
+// runs workbench.action.chat.triggerSetup, a command patches/0004 never
+// registers (clicking it only logs "command not found"). Its Inline
+// Suggestions toggles write product.defaultChatAgent.completionsEnablementSetting
+// (`github.copilot.enable`), which HUPI's own inline completions don't
+// read. Same reasoning as 0004/0006: don't show a Copilot control that
+// does nothing.
